{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026KzPIKHqMyV1792998688.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>網上近日流傳一段車Cam片段，事發地點在啟德晴朗商場對開馬路，當時不少行人正有序使用斑馬線過馬路，前方車輛亦慢駛讓路，豈料後方一輛紅色私家車竟抽頭逆線駛出，企圖在斑馬線前爬頭橫過。當時剛好有一隊軍裝警員巡經現場，其中3名警員目擊過程後，立即上前將該輛紅色私家車截停，並指示司機駛往路邊接受調查。</p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-10-26-15h05m42s445.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026Ntbd5qcKbb1792998649.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p>影片引起熱議，不少人指司機駕駛態度離譜：「師兄，唔好咁癲啦」、「班馬線逆線行？好似危駕」、「之字線不準切線，條友無考過筆試？」亦有大批網民紛紛留言調侃：「一次過有咁多人『招呼』佢，真係抵佢死」、「咁多人招呼，抵俾640啦」。</p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-10-26-15h05m38s775.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026rj0TECfET21792998656.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T08:00:31.084929+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":260,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T07:09:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T10:38:06.097910+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T07:58:07.861001+00:00","content_hash":"e1db5622fe0235f940d10109773cf4d73fef4e2f1da221a06f78c55464b9e7e8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T08:00:31.084929+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}